{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_st03",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_03",
  "title": "空曠的大街",
  "storyCode": "SN-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "da2e6b726f83e99835c80637ab109edbc350827f9e732bb1fd90032fc4826ec9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "text": "艾麗妮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "欸？啊，我在，老師......不，長官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "text": "你還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "我......我沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "text": "格蘭法洛只是一座小鎮，在很多地圖上也許都找不到的小鎮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "text": "即使如此，這也是卡門閣下的委託，與凱爾希醫生和那幾個阿戈爾人都有關聯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "我知道，長官，所以我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "text": "如果你還得不出答案，我不允許你同行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "選擇成為審判官跟隨長官的時候，我就已經做好了準備！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "text": "如果你得出的答案還無法詮釋你之前的所見所聞，就更不要簡單得出結論。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "text": "不要白白送死，艾麗妮。你已經明白我們對抗的是什麼，你必須得出你自己的答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "......我明白了，長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "凱爾希女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭的語調沒有變化，但她的腳步能夠反映出她的心情。\n只消一瞬，風發出聲響所需的時間，她就來到了凱爾希的身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "辛苦了，歌蕾蒂婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "審判庭似乎沒有對你做什麼，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "伊比利亞還沒有沉沒，這就是他們尚存些微謙卑與警覺的證明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你找到辦法了，如我們所約定的那樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "是的。但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "......如果伊比利亞願意放下他們所擔憂的，那阿戈爾呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "如果我們別無他路......而短暫的合作能幫助我們回到海洋，我願意合作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "總算有個像樣的阿戈爾人了，對吧？就像浪濤本身，就像海洋的光線與觸感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "你好啊，特別的阿戈爾人。我想你已經見過我們的其他成員了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "是的，那麼，您也是日落即逝的成員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "貝斯手Alty。很高興見到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "外面怎麼樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "那些深海教徒傾巢而出，數量不少，但很弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "獵人們足以處理所有問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "解決格蘭法洛的問題後，審判庭才會與我們合作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "那就讓我們立刻開始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭提起了她的長槊。\n可幾乎與此同時，她感到了某種異樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......不，這些恐魚中混雜著......不可能......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "凱爾希醫生！他們的目的是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "......極境？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "我們的幹員遇到了危險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "有什麼潛藏在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "......Alty，就像我們說的那樣。日落即逝的各位，只要留在岸上就足夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "我們會儘快解決問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "好啊，我們等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "如果你們的征途需要一些音樂點綴的話，那我們更樂意效勞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......太弱了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "它們這樣前仆後繼，就像在拖延時間......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......又或者，它們是在......散播什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "得找出它們的老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "text": "——嘎——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "幽靈鯊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "啊......你在這裡，斯卡蒂。好久不見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "有什麼事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......你還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "很好，只是，有些睏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "嗯......我們在戰鬥，對吧，這些海洋的氣息......總讓人想起......故鄉的味道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "可是，故鄉？我的故鄉......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "text": "嘎——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......海。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "海的氣味越來越濃烈，斯卡蒂，我們回家了嗎？這裡是回家的路嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......會是的，幽靈鯊，勞倫緹娜，我保證。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "那請告訴我......我眼前的又是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "眼前？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人影從街道那頭走來，輕哼著旋律。\n鎮民的慌亂留給街道一片狼藉，可年輕的Frost眼中仿若無物。她撥弄著空氣，想像著音樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "text": "（搖動的窸窣聲）——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......恐魚沒有靠近她，不，就像她不存在一樣......她那是在彈琴嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "好聽嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "那不如問問她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "哈啊、哈啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "（沒跟上來......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "......壞了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "難道是剛見面的時候......不是吧，我都閃開了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "......伊比利亞人，那些資料必須銷毀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "你可以四肢健全地服從我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "（該死，這傢伙動作怎麼這麼快......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "......真奇怪，你的同伴是匆忙撤離才不得不燒掉這些文件的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "你有這樣的身手，搶回去帶走不是更省事？執著於燒掉做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "同伴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人低吟了片刻，某種聲響在他的喉間蠕動，那是一種屈辱導致的沙啞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "我們......不是同伴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "那是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "與你無關......你只要交出那些文件，然後離開這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "無論你是審判庭的人，還是其他國家的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "（怎麼停下了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "是啊......你們一向那麼敏銳。一直都是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這個神秘的阿戈爾人目視著某個方向。\n“同伴”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "（阿戈爾語）我們血脈相連，可現在，你們必須遠離阿戈爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "極境避開了。可是他也在此刻明白，自己為什麼能避開。\n那些還泛著焦黑的紙張被劍氣掀起，真相碎成無數，在半空中飄落零散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "text": "糟糕——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "（阿戈爾語）她們還不能回到阿戈爾，再放任所有人一意孤行，只會加速阿戈爾的毀滅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "text": "（阿戈爾語）儘管阿戈爾早已選擇了......自取滅亡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "沒有恐魚還在靠近了嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "地處海邊，從數量而言，並不意外。你們都躲藏在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "你......咳咳......那、那盞燈！把你的燈拿開......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "回答我。你們覬覦格蘭法洛的什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "燈、燈！不，把這燈拿開......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "回答我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "是......是那個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "嗯？你指著什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡門回過頭去，順著深海教徒所指的方向望去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一座雕塑。孤立在廣場正中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "格蘭法洛，燈塔。是，你們當然在格蘭法洛尋找燈塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "停下......停下你的法術......呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "這些工業的宏偉造物曾被貴族們稱讚為“伊比利亞之眼”。過去，伊比利亞的海岸邊有數十座這樣的燈塔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "哪怕萊塔尼亞的巫王高塔沒有被摧毀，也無法與這些看守海洋的巨物媲美。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "它們是人類文明留在這片大地上的最偉大的痕跡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "海洋......咳咳......伊比利亞之眼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "神跡......徹底毀掉了那些褻瀆之物......呃啊......拿走你的燈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "大靜謐摧毀了大多數燈塔，剩下的也幾乎無法使用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "你們在盤算著什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "原來如此。你們知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "你們知道還有最後一座燈塔可以投入使用，你們知道，格蘭法洛所有計劃的最終目的就是保護那座伊比利亞之眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "所以你們盤踞在這裡，等待時機？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "......你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "連審判庭的中樞裡都有叛徒，這是我沒有預料到的。他們在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "......哼......哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "在你......喋喋不休的時候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的教徒",
      "text": "看看你的腳下吧......再一次認識到......你們有多麼的狹隘......可悲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瀕死的恐魚",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瀕死的恐魚",
      "text": "......（令人不安的窸窣聲）......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "這些恐魚的身體......在發光？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "這些光斑是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "卡門閣下，請遠離！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "Mon3tr！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "text": "（不耐煩的低鳴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "熔毀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "text": "（激昂的咆哮）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "你好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（一段平穩的獨奏）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "你身上......有熟悉的氣息。你知道那是什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（一段激昂的獨奏）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......美妙的旋律，但與我所知的大不相同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "......那，你所知的是什麼樣的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "當她祈禱，星星停止閃爍♪\n當她流淚，夜晚露出微笑♪\n當她悲歎，痛苦蔓延在她的瘋狂♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "......阿戈爾的歌。哀傷的歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "可我不喜歡。它屬於過去，它放下了熱情，徒勞感傷。和阿戈爾一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "很遺憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "阿戈爾人，你回家了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "回家？我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "歌唱吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "這是你找回自己的辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "歌唱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "我......能靠歌唱回想起什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "唱吧，你會遇見你的過去。你遲早要面對你的命運，或是讓命運找上你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "我離開海洋之後，就一直如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......奇怪的人。但是，歌唱，我不討厭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "那就歌唱吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "哼哼，哼哼哼♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "當她祈禱，星星停止閃爍♪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "......還是這樣讓人悲傷的歌聲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "你是......誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "沒想到我們會在這樣的情況下再見，勞倫緹娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
